        <name>XSecure_VerifyLibCompatibility</name>
        <param>
          <type>XSecure_ClientInstance *</type>
          <declname>InstancePtr</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Verifies that the client XilSecure library is compatible with the running server (PLM) XilSecure library. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>    The client compile-time version (XSecure_GetLibVersion()) is compared against the
    version reported by the server. Compatibility requires the major versions to match
    and the client minor version to be less than or equal to the server minor version
    (a newer server stays backward compatible with an older client).
</verbatim></para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>InstancePtr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the client instance (mailbox handle + SlrIndex).</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>XST_SUCCESS - Client and server library versions are compatible</para></listitem><listitem><para>XSECURE_LIB_VERSION_MAJOR_MISMATCH - Major versions differ (breaking change)</para></listitem><listitem><para>XSECURE_LIB_VERSION_MINOR_MISMATCH - Client minor is newer than the server</para></listitem><listitem><para>XST_INVALID_PARAM / Error - On transport failure while querying the server </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
